OL,3,GNEWSALucy's Law: A real bite on NI's
OL,4,Aillegal puppy trade or a toothless
OL,5,Aattack?
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegislation to help tackle Northern
OL,8,FIreland's illegal puppy trade was
OL,9,Fapproved earlier this week.
OL,11,FIf introduced as planned, Lucy's Law
OL,12,Fwould put Northern Ireland on a par
OL,13,Fwith the rest of the UK by making
OL,14,Fthird-party puppy and kitten sales
OL,15,Fillegal.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
