OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALucy's Law: A real bite on NI's
OL,4,Aillegal puppy trade or a toothless
OL,5,Aattack?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMinister Andrew Muir addressed a
OL,8,Fconference of vets, animal charities
OL,9,Fand legal experts on Tuesday and
OL,10,Fdescribed Lucy's Law as "a major step"
OL,11,Fforward in disrupting dealer chains and
OL,12,Fstrengthening safeguards for puppies
OL,13,Fand kittens.
OL,15,FSome front-line rescue workers,
OL,16,Fhowever, have argued that the
OL,17,Fregulations do not go far enough,
OL,18,Fclaiming gaps have been left that could
OL,19,Fcontinue to be exploited.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
